  unitName: Heartless Hadaron
  unitId: 860135
  unitNumber: 8075
  description: Created by the old gods, birthed from the deep fires of earth, Hadaron
    is a demi-god with a toughened body that could withstand high pressure and extreme
    heat. Though his combat prowess could not match Ultor and Tridon, he overcomes
    tough situations with perseverance and sheer determination. Zedus appointed Hadaron
    in guarding the under city beneath Athensphere, for demons and corruption didn't
    just come from the sea and the lands above. Gazia helped him setup defenses and
    they were close. When the augmentation wars broke out, Gazia turned the under
    city defenses against Hadaron's forces ripping chaos throughout the depths of
    Athensphere. Upset and angry about Gazia's betrayal, Hadaron vows to end Gazia's
    madness.
  summonDesc: Ten down. Who's next?
  fusionDesc: Gods of the depths, grant me strength..
  evoDesc: Why.. Brother..
  element: 6
  rarity: 4
